sent-is-sick-of-hearing-about-the-k-shaped-economy-and-declares-its-overbut-the-data-would-beg-to-disagree/</guid></item><item><title>向您的员工询问一个有关人工智能的问题。沉默会告诉你一切</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/05/are-your-employees-actually-building-with-ai-agents/</link><description>人工智能使构建变得更加容易，但大多数员工仍然没有创建任何可重复使用的东西。隐藏的障碍是你的员工认为他们是谁。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2177606089.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 05 Aug 2026 11:30:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/05/are-your-employees-actually-building-with-ai-agents/</guid></item><item><title>价值 250 亿美元的数据中心表明圣路易斯认真参与人工智能经济竞争</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/05/25-billion-data-centers-st-louis/</link><description>当明尼阿波利斯和纽约正在踩刹车时，圣路易斯地区决定立即参与美国的新基础设施竞赛。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-1204302722-e1785848559513.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 05 Aug 2026 11:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/05/25-billion-data-centers-st-louis/</guid></item><item><title>与伊朗就霍尔木兹海峡达成协议——附带一卡车的警告——最快可能在今天达成</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/05/iran-deal-strait-of-hormuz-trump/</link><description>今天早上到达办公室之前您需要了解的所有信息。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2285799466.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 05 Aug 2026 10:03:56 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/05/iran-deal-strait-of-hormuz-trump/</guid></item></channel></rss>